{
  "slug": "mcp2cli",
  "name": "Mcp2cli",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Convert MCP servers to token-efficient CLI tools with auto-generated SKILL.md files for Claude Code agents",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 agent** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `mcp-analyze` (Analyze MCP server source code to classify its pattern and assess CLI conversion feasibility), `mcp-codegen` (Generate TypeScript CLI tool code from an MCP server analysis), `skill-author` (Generate a SKILL.md file for a CLI tool so Claude Code can use it effectively)\n- **Agents** (1): `mcp-analyzer` (Analyze MCP server source code to extract tool definitions, parameters, and architecture patterns for CLI conversion planning)\n- **Commands** (3): `analyze-mcp` (Analyze an MCP server without converting it), `convert` (Start an MCP-to-CLI conversion workflow), `generate-skill` (Generate a SKILL.md file for an existing CLI tool)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mcp2cli@claude-community` from `myeolinmalchi/mcp2cli`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 1,
    "command": 3
  },
